          "from": "PMP *walu 'eight'",
          "to": "Javanese wolu (ka-wolu 'eight times')",
          "note": "Earlier Javanese *a in an open final syllable became [ɔ] in Central and Eastern Javanese, and a preceding *a assimilated; Western dialects keep [a]. In wolu the change is fixed in the spelling."
